OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a light shower across
OL,6,Fthe north at first. Otherwise it will
OL,7,Fbe a dry day with variable amounts and
OL,8,Fsome bright or sunny spells.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,11,FThen thickening cloud and outbreaks of
OL,12,Frain will spread from the west during
OL,13,Fthe early hours. Freshening southerly
OL,14,Fwinds along the east coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FA cloudy morning with rain
OL,17,Fspreading east. Becoming drier and
OL,18,Fbrighter from the west in the
OL,19,Fafternoon with a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
