OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry with
OL,6,Fsunny intervals on Friday. Rain will
OL,7,Fspread east on Saturday, drying up
OL,8,Ffrom the west in the afternoon. Dry
OL,9,Fand bright on Sunday.
